Here is a comprehensive summary of the repository at `/home/silimon/MCP-Auto`:

---

## Repository Overview

**MCP-Auto** is a comprehensive MCP (Model Context Protocol) server automatic deployment agent. The repo is primarily in Chinese and written by author Silimon001. It automates the process of discovering, analyzing, deploying, and validating third-party MCP servers.

---

## Top-Level Structure

| Path | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `.claude/` | Claude Code skills directory |
| `.git/` | Git repository |
| `.traces/` | Claude Code session traces (JSONL logs) |
| `.venv/` | Python virtual environment |
| `claude_code/` | Experiment scripts (wrappers for exp2, exp3, analysis) |
| `data/` | Dataset with READMEs, repo info, benchmark data (py, js_ts, MCP-Bench, LiveMCPBench) |
| `data.zip` | 104MB archive of data |
| `get_data/` | Data collection pipeline scripts (0-7) |
| `log_file/` | Experiment logs (py, js_ts, MCP-Bench, old_data subdirs) |
| `mcp-auto/` | Core Python deployment agent code |
